{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The last digit of the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a7272f3e94c3a09c26b828c76d02f6cca0655e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^{2007}+3^{2007}+5^{2007}+7^{2007}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"244\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b93a5398a00fd0eea55bfebd85184760b68adf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 6\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbb529b580992b8101f6692e98dce9e66b58419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007\\bmod4}\\equiv2^3\\equiv8\\mod10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d12eea82abb1c1f8c9d3903ce5c7e976318e9eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2007\\bmod4}\\equiv3^3\\equiv7\\mod10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0961976ab4a2ed885788d70d931b3fcfd013bc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2007\\bmod4}\\equiv5^3\\equiv5\\mod10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/baf7bb70e8d779e5cd3f167578ba82ea7a373032.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2007\\bmod4}\\equiv7^3\\equiv3\\mod10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70ef00742dbfdd5ea412257ec380057c24e080dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8+7+5+3\\equiv3\\mod10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"207\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Ly